{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122098","id":4206094295,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc76s-fX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122098","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122098.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122098.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122098","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122098/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122098/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122098/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a4b2c2276257a9f3997d26fd940b56e791367181","number":122098,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix bug in `OpenXRUtil::string_from_xruuid`","user":{"login":"dhoverb","id":226178021,"node_id":"U_kgDODXsz5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226178021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb","html_url":"https://github.com/dhoverb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhoverb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n`OpenXRUtil::string_from_xruuid` was generating the wrong hexadecimal string from `XrUuid`, due to `>>` having higher precedence than `&`.\r\n\r\nIn particular, this:\r\n```c++\r\nchar a = xr_uuid.data[i] & 0xF0 >> 4;\r\nchar b = xr_uuid.data[i] & 0x0F;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIs equivalent to\r\n```c++\r\nchar a = xr_uuid.data[i] & 0x0F;\r\nchar b = xr_uuid.data[i] & 0x0F;\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis would result in the hexadecimal string appearing to duplicate the last 4 bits of each 8 bit number.\r\nFor example, the base 10 value of `33` would incorrectly become `0x11` (`33` is `0x21`)\r\n\r\nThis PR adds parenthesis so that `&` is evaluated before `>>`","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url